WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.609
24:21, set point. A wins the rally.

2
00:00:04.659 --> 00:00:09.708
25 points, two ahead: the set ends. Check the end time, then "Confirm".

3
00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:12.142
The interval runs. The teams have changed sides.

4
00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:15.457
Teams ready? "End set interval". Then the line-ups of set 2.

5
00:00:15.507 --> 00:00:17.291
2 sets each: the deciding set 5 (tie-break) to 15 points.

6
00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:23.189
A new coin toss: set the sides and the first serve, then "Confirm set 5 setup".

7
00:00:23.239 --> 00:00:27.634
Set 5: A leads 7:5 and wins the next rally.

8
00:00:27.684 --> 00:00:32.550
8 points: "Court switch required". Tap "Switch courts".

9
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.962
The teams play on, on the other side.
